  "helpCaseA4": "Record: when you sell, record the sale income.",
  "helpCaseAEnd": "Check the Overview: balance and indicators start making sense.",
  "helpCaseBTitle": "Case B — I'm going to plant something new",
  "helpCaseB1": "Crops: create your crop with stage Establishment (cycle Annual or Perennial).",
  "helpCaseB2": "Plantings: record the initial planting (plants and area; you can link its cost).",
  "helpCaseB3": "In establishment the app does not flag losses: it is investment, not production.",
  "helpCaseB4": "When it reaches Production, follow the Case A flow of harvests and sales.",
  "helpUnitsTitle": "Units",
  "helpUnitsBody": "Use kg, or arroba (12.5 kg) and bag (70 kg) for coffee. The app converts everything to kg for comparison.",
  "helpGlossaryTitle": "Glossary",
  "helpGlossaryBody": "Seedlings: young plantation in establishment. Area: crop surface. Live plants: current total (planting − losses + replanting). Destination: sold, stored or loss. Sync: saves to the cloud to log in from any device. Alert: automatic notice on the Overview.",
